  "body": "Is there any description what should be happen when we create `script` element via `Document.createElement()/Document.createElementNS()` and, for example, we put it to document? Is it executed or not and from what it depends?\nI see that [script has some flags](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#script-processing-model) and other mechanizm but it seems that all relate to the parser. Can someone point me where I should start looking?\n",
